{"id":"hoffentlich","lemma":"hoffentlich","pos":"adv","rank":679,"glosses":["hopefully (it is hoped that)"],"ipa":"/ˈhɔfn̩tlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/De-hoffentlich.ogg/De-hoffentlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hoffentlich kommst du zurück.","en":"I hope you'll come back.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Ich mache hoffentlich keinen Fehler.","en":"I hope I'm not making a mistake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"}]},{"text":"Du weißt hoffentlich, was du tust.","en":"You know what you're doing, I hope.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]},{"text":"Sie wissen hoffentlich, was Sie tun.","en":"You know what you're doing, I hope.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to know"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Hoffentlich passiert das nicht.","en":"Hopefully, that won't happen.","words":[null,{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"}]}]}